DTSTAMP:20260825T050943Z
DESCRIPTION:An open mic exploring resistance\, rage\, joy\, and everything in between.\n\nIn a time when conversations around caste\, gender\, sexuality\, identity\, and power continue to shape our everyday lives\, creating spaces for expression\, dialogue\, and solidarity is more important than ever. Join us for an engaging evening of performances including comedy\, music\, poetry\, and storytelling\, to share experiences\, perspectives\, and questions — while coming together in community. You can take the mic or simply be part of the audience. What matters is creating a space where different voices can be heard\, ideas can be challenged\, and resistance can also make room for joy.\n\nWant to perform? Register using this link below and share your performance details with us.
DTEND:20260829T130000Z
DTSTART:20260829T113000Z
SUMMARY:The Resistance is a Party in the Keri
